{"id":12912934221,"name":"WarCommand","desc":"A classic RTS (real time strategy) experience on Roblox. Build a base, command an army, and prepare for war!\nDestroy all enemy bases to win.\n\n\n-- PC -- \nLeft Click: Select Unit\nRight Click: Move Unit / Attack Unit\n-- Mobile --\nTap: Select Unit \nHold: Move Unit / Attack Unit\n\nThis game is new and still in development. Feel free to DM me any issues, bugs, or suggestions!","path":"/game/12912934221-warcommand","slug":"12912934221-warcommand","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-35fd69f9dd0370fe9c24ce568d206a47/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ea1d7223d35dd6e4afd7a7b7ecc720b8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":53,"visitor":26089605,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-06-20T15:26:09.362Z","creator":{"name":"nikplz","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"WarCommand-Make-your-units-intelligent-with-custom-paths-238168","_id":"6a36b111c775c9d2ea014ef7","title":"Make your units intelligent with custom paths","game":{"_id":"6893d4f9c23f749e7052f89b","gameId":12912934221,"name":"WarCommand","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-ea1d7223d35dd6e4afd7a7b7ecc720b8-3b73c66e96d6.png","placeId":12912934221},"features":"Tired of the game's crappy unit movement system? Why not make them more intelligent using this!\n\n[ HOW TO USE ]\nCreate a path by placing nodes which the units will follow. The order of placement will be the order in which units follow first (Just look at labels above)\n\n[ FEATURES ]\n-> Can create up to four paths (Units will go to the nearest first node)\n-> Delete the current path selected (Do note that units following that path will just stop)\n-> Move all Units (Make all units follow the nearest path)\n-> Auto March (All units that are spawned will follow the nearest path)\n-> Destroy all paths (Do note that units following the paths will just stop)\n-> The spreading of the units (How much you want to spread your units out, smaller number means they are closer together)\n-> Auto-shoot where they will destroy anything blocking their way","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ThetrulyAnonymous/ScriptsCollection/refs/heads/main/PathCreator.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"69d3c376e52e8dc73f4ccc9b","username":"Theultimateuser","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"69d3c376e52e8dc73f4ccc9b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000}},"verified":false,"views":266,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/rbx-ea1d7223d35dd6e4afd7a7b7ecc720b8-3b73c66e96d6.png","likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-06-20T15:26:09.363Z","executes":116,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a36b111c775c9d2ea014ef9","editBy":{"_id":"69d3c376e52e8dc73f4ccc9b","username":"Theultimateuser","status":"offline","id":"69d3c376e52e8dc73f4ccc9b"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-06-20T15:26:09.367Z"}],"comments":[]},{"slug":"WarCommand-Best-Script-Keyless-60086","_id":"68f9165d4ec2e2af18a6ab7b","title":"Best Script Keyless","game":{"_id":"6893d4f9c23f749e7052f89b","gameId":12912934221,"name":"WarCommand","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-ea1d7223d35dd6e4afd7a7b7ecc720b8-3b73c66e96d6.png","placeId":12912934221},"features":"Exploits Tab\nUnits Tab","tags":["WarCommand","WarCommands","WarCommandScript","RobloxWarCommand","RobloxWarCommandScript"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KGuestCheatsJ2/Sc/refs/heads/main/WarC\"))()","owner":{"_id":"67a7739c0b161be29e8ab193","username":"KGuestCheatsJHUB","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/67a7739c0b161be29e8ab193-1782134935348.jpg","status":"offline","id":"67a7739c0b161be29e8ab193","leaderboard":{"tag":null},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts